flowchart LR
  P[Managed ESP32-S3 nodes<br/>OFF / SIMULATED / advertised LIVE] -->|contact / config sync / sparse HTTPS telemetry| I[FarmPi node + ingest API]
  S[Legacy opt-in simulator<br/>16 virtual locations] -->|bearer-auth simulated telemetry| I
  I --> D[(MariaDB)]

  W[Diagnostic browser] --> A[FastAPI application API]
  N[Native Android<br/>Dashboard / Compare / Ask / History / Nodes] -->|HTTPS farmpi.local| A
  N -->|administrator registration + desired sensor modes| A

  A --> R[Deterministic fast router]
  R -->|clear farm fact / action / boundary| X[Validated application operation]
  R -->|language genuinely unclear| M[Semantic interpreter]
  M -->|validated structured intent| X

  X <--> D
  X --> G[Verified analytics / charts / evidence]
  X --> PEV[Authoritative FarmPi facts]

  A --> K[Source / provenance layer]
  PEV --> K
  EXT[Reviewed external source material] --> K
  K --> Q[Pi-local Qwen3 0.6B via llama.cpp<br/>explanation / paraphrase / conversation]
  Q --> A
  G --> A

  A -->|answer / chart / evidence / status| N
